if errors.Is(err, ErrTimeout) { err = gateway.Lookup(n+1) }; return err.
The first call's ErrTimeout is replaced, but the second call can return ErrTimeout again: all 4 Lookup
origins must appear; ErrTimeout only with a path through the second call (line of the reassignment).
